#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Execução de código {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Clique em **Run** em qualquer bloco de código. O primeiro clique inicia um "
"kernel Jupyter via [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code "
"Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Depois disso, as execuções são "
"instantâneas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Modo Simulador (não precisa de conta)** — Habilite o [Modo "
"Simulador](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) para executar todos os "
"notebooks com AerSimulator ou FakeBackends com modelo de ruído. Nenhuma "
"configuração necessária.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hardware IBM Quantum** — Insira seu token de API e CRN nas "
"[Configurações](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) uma vez — as credenciais são "
"auto-injetadas em cada execução. [Crie uma conta "
"gratuita](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) se você não tiver "
"uma.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backends de execução disponíveis</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Todo tutorial tem blocos de código executáveis. Clique em **Run** para "
"executá-los usando um dos quatro backends:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (padrão no GitHub Pages) — Kernel Jupyter remoto gratuito via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless na sua conta IBM Cloud. "
"Inicialização a frio em segundos. [Configurar](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jupyter local (Docker / RasQberry)** — Conecta ao servidor Jupyter local "
"com Qiskit pré-instalado\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Servidor customizado** — Aponte para qualquer endpoint Jupyter nas "
"[Configurações](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Quando vários backends estão disponíveis, escolha qual usar em "
"[Configurações](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opções de implantação</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation está disponível como:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Site estático com "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) para execução remota de código\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Pilha completa localmente, capaz de funcionar offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with "
"local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Auto-hospedado em Raspberry Pi com"
" kernel Jupyter local\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Execute localmente com Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instale [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) ou [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), então execute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works "
"locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Abra [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — a execução de código "
"funciona localmente, sem tempo de espera do Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Para uma versão leve sem execução local de código (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are"
" identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple "
"Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usando Docker em vez disso? Apenas substitua `podman` por `docker` — os "
"comandos são idênticos. As imagens são multi-arquitetura (`linux/amd64` + "
"`linux/arm64`), então Macs Apple Silicon funcionam nativamente.\n"
